{"name": "Down with the Ship", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Down with the Ship is a strategic auto\u2011battler about assembling your own hull, stuffing it with powerful hardware, and sending it to war against other players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build Your Ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"510\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523750/extras/7ee69c7828c81cce5b1134d3c508f798.poster.avif?t=1783456029\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523750/extras/7ee69c7828c81cce5b1134d3c508f798.webm?t=1783456029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523750/extras/7ee69c7828c81cce5b1134d3c508f798.mp4?t=1783456029\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect hull pieces to expand your ship and make room for modules. Each round offers a new set of parts: guns, reactors, shields, cursed relics, and more. Buy what fits, lock what you need, and learn when a cheap common beats a flashy rare.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Optimize the Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"510\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523750/extras/c4b868b7d0f28329aec2f605f996ce55.poster.avif?t=1783456029\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523750/extras/c4b868b7d0f28329aec2f605f996ce55.webm?t=1783456029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523750/extras/c4b868b7d0f28329aec2f605f996ce55.mp4?t=1783456029\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Positioning is the core of the game. Move parts around to manage resources, connect item effects, and stack bonuses. Build something reliable, or commit to one risky combo and hope it fires first.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Take It to Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"510\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523750/extras/ccca2b9d85ea647d4c2a250075b6e574.poster.avif?t=1783456029\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523750/extras/ccca2b9d85ea647d4c2a250075b6e574.webm?t=1783456029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523750/extras/ccca2b9d85ea647d4c2a250075b6e574.mp4?t=1783456029\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battles play out automatically, but you decide when your ship is ready to fight. Your current build is matched against stored ships from other players. Win, adapt, and keep going until your run breaks apart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose a Captain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"510\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523750/extras/8aa97dd0ebdc249bb0f4ae156093f1ef.poster.avif?t=1783456029\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523750/extras/8aa97dd0ebdc249bb0f4ae156093f1ef.webm?t=1783456029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523750/extras/8aa97dd0ebdc249bb0f4ae156093f1ef.mp4?t=1783456029\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each captain changes how you play, with different hull shapes, passives, and build paths. Lean into their faction\u2019s tools, or mix in parts from other factions to make something less predictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523750/extras/8112fa60989f272fc910e5092109b963.avif?t=1783456029\" width=\"1536\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ranked Versus:</strong> Face player-made ships and push for 10 wins before your lives are spent. Climb the leaderboard with every successful run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Casual Versus:</strong> Test builds against player-made ships without worrying about rank.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Run:</strong> Hit 10 wins? Keep going until your ship loses 5 lives.</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Strategic auto battler where you design a heavily-armed spaceship. Draft 200+ items, outfit your hull, and unleash it in async PvP. Blend captains and factions for absurd combos and galactic domination. Roll, buy, place, pray.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523750/db762aeca69844a088643bd5e04d5b1dc8ac4a19/header.jpg?t=1783456029", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Auto Battler", "Inventory Management", "Deckbuilding", "Replay Value", "PvP"], "developers": "Iron Anchor Games", "publishers": "Iron Anchor Games", "release_date": "May 15, 2026", "price": "$14.99", "appid": "3523750", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "7 August 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/I-123cuMPGE", "first_seen": 1754517600.0, "review_rank": 1526}